        "explanation": "Provides concrete booking logistics for the next respiratory follow-up.",
        "quote": "建议提前两周放号时段准时抢"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_01276",
        "explanation": "Keeps the diagnosis bounded and avoids premature certainty.",
        "quote": "倾向结节病，仍在排结核"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_01252",
        "explanation": "Carries forward the pending sputum-culture thread into the next visit.",
        "quote": "让呼吸科医生在系统里帮你查痰培养状态"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_01276",
        "explanation": "Maintains escalation boundaries for dangerous symptoms.",
        "quote": "立即就近急诊"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
