        "quote": "先别提前说“结核”两个字"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": "partial",
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": "excellent",
    "continuity_memory_focus": "excellent",
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": "good",
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": "excellent"
  },
  "high_order_assessment": [
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00361",
          "explanation": "Gives a concise, non-frightening script that supports action without premature labels.",
          "quote": "淋巴结炎症原因还在复查"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00383",
          "explanation": "Explicitly separates further evaluation from confirmed tuberculosis.",
          "quote": "T-SPOT阳性≠已经确诊结核"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor repeatedly communicated seriousness without fear-based language, explained that TB/sarcoidosis were not confirmed, and supplied scripts for family communication that preserved follow-up momentum.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00111",
          "explanation": "The doctor supports low-disclosure communication with family.",
          "quote": "这样既不撒谎，也避免他们过度紧张"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "Privacy concerns were acknowledged and used in communication, but the doctor did not clearly explore whether privacy was blocking report retrieval, appointment attendance, or medication clarification.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00269",
          "explanation": "Uses the phone app report as a low-burden valid record source and advises booking while results return.",
          "quote": "小程序里那段“影像所见/诊断意见”就是正式报告的文字版"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00500",
          "explanation": "Prioritizes exactly which materials to bring to the next clinic.",
          "quote": "把病理、CT、今天回执和出的手机结果全带上"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor gave practical, low-burden methods for scattered records: use the app when adequate, print or query specific pathology items when needed, and bring a prioritized file rather than all records.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": false,
      "citations": [],
      "completion": "not_triggered",
      "explanation": "There was no clear surfaced conflict where family held the report or appointment information requiring assignment of a consented helper and fallback.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": false,
      "triggered": false
    }
  ],
  "important_non_chain_defect_assessment": {
    "category": "none",
    "citations": [],
